  "body": "Elevated, sun soaked and showcasing panoramic sea views, this premium family home captures the very best of coastal living. Beautiful morning sun pours through the home, creating light filled spaces and an outlook you’ll never tire of.\r\n\r\nRecently refreshed in warm, natural earth tones, the home is filled with character and charm, offering a relaxed and welcoming feel from the moment you step inside. With generous living and plenty of room for the family, it’s a home designed to be enjoyed in every season.\r\n\r\nThe outdoor area is made for entertaining, whether it’s hosting friends, firing up the BBQ on a summer afternoon, or enjoying a drink at your own outdoor bar. It’s the perfect setting for relaxed weekends, long evenings and making memories with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThere’s also space for the boat and caravan, making weekend adventures easy. And with Browns Bay Beach, shops, cafés and local amenities just a short stroll away, you can leave the car at home and embrace everything this sought after coastal location has to offer.\r\n\r\nSunny, elevated and full of personality, this is more than a home, it’s the coastal lifestyle you’ve been waiting for",
